# © 2026 Arsenal Quant Project
# Global .gitignore — Ghost Protocol compliant

# Ignore everything by default
*

# --- WHITELIST: PUBLIC INTERFACE LAYER ONLY ---

# Root documentation & registry files
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/smithery.yaml
!/glama.json

# Public engine folder (Ghost Protocol name)
!/decision_engine/
!/decision_engine/**

# --- GLOBAL EXCLUSIONS (applied inside all whitelisted folders) ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/data/
**/logs/
